### Login (fresh)
POST http://localhost:5017/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@mitsubishi.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}


### Create ServiceType - Servis Berkala 10K
POST http://localhost:5017/api/servicetypes
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..8d4hv3KTc4ljhmOmpCkqQeuPdJngo4HYXA1sg_SXx4k
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "PERIODIC-10K",
  "name": "Servis Berkala 10.000 KM",
  "description": "Ganti oli, filter oli, cek rem, cek kelistrikan",
  "category": "Periodic",
  "estimatedDuration": 90,
  "estimatedCost": 750000
}

